## On the job {.unnumbered}

::: callout-important
## Why this matters day to day

Almost every People Analytics deliverable involves ranking or comparing
groups of unequal size: offices, recruiting channels, onboarding
cohorts, manager populations. Empirical Bayes is the fastest tool in
this book for stopping a stakeholder from over-reacting to the office
with four people and one bad month. It costs you one extra line of R
and no modelling framework — there's rarely a reason *not* to check a
raw rate this way before it goes in a deck.
:::

